category: Libs
requires: libusb1.0-devel libuvc0 pkg-config libjpeg-devel
sdesc: "Cross-platform library for USB video devices (development)"
ldesc: "libuvc is a cross-platform library for USB video devices, built atop libusb.
It enables fine-grained control over USB video devices exporting the standard
USB Video Class (UVC) interface, enabling developers to write drivers for
previously unsupported devices, or just access UVC devices in a generic
fashion."
external-source: libuvc

